message: "If you use this work, please cite the note below."
title: "Explicit String Vacua and the Geometric Selection Conjecture: research manuscript and construction checks"
abstract: >-
  Research revision with explicit partial geometric constructions,
  normalization bounds, a quantitative stability criterion and a local
  effective-theory example. The full GSC remains unproved and no common
  nine-condition vacuum is constructed. New author review is pending.
